{
  "slug": "corebee",
  "name": "Corebee",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI customer support operations toolkit — manage conversations, contacts, knowledge base, analytics, and team workload. 9 skills, 4 agents, 3 commands, hooks, and configurable settings.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills**, **4 agents**, **4 commands**, **3 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `agent-signup` (Create a brand-new Corebee account from the terminal — no dashboard, no browser login), `contact-onboard` (Onboard a new contact into the support system by checking for duplicates, creating their profile, and adding contextual…), `customer-360` (Get a complete customer profile by aggregating contact details, conversation history, notes, and relevant knowledge base articles into…), `escalation-manager` (Handle urgent customer conversations end-to-end — identify critical issues, assign to the best available agent, log escalation notes,…), `inbox-triage` (Triage and prioritize open support conversations by reviewing unassigned tickets, identifying urgent issues, and suggesting agent assignments based…), `knowledge-manager` (Manage the AI knowledge base by listing sources, checking indexing status, adding new URLs, searching indexed content, and…), `metrics-compare` (Compare support metrics between two time periods side-by-side — see what improved, what declined, and calculate percentage deltas…), `team-workload` (Analyze team capacity and workload distribution — see who is overloaded, who has bandwidth, and rebalance conversation assignments…), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (4): `conversation-helper` (Specialized agent for handling customer conversations), `kb-optimizer` (Specialized agent for optimizing the AI knowledge base), `sla-monitor` (Specialized agent for monitoring SLA compliance across all open conversations), `support-analyst` (Specialized agent for analyzing support operations data)\n- **Commands** (4): `kb-status` (Check the health of your AI knowledge base — shows indexed sources, pending items, errors, and coverage gaps), `report` (Generate a weekly support performance report with KPIs, team rankings, channel breakdown, and AI automation stats), `signup` (Create a brand-new Corebee account from your terminal — one email approval, then a scoped API key +…), `triage` (Triage the support inbox — shows urgent conversations, stale tickets, and suggests assignments)\n- **Hooks** (3): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SubagentStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `corebee`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install corebee@claude-community` from `jonny-1812/corebee-mcp-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
